    </p><a href="/">← Home</a><pagefind-searchbox></pagefind-searchbox><script type="module" src="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="/static/pagefind.js"></script><h1 class="instruction-section" data-pagefind-body="1" data-pagefind-weight="10" data-pagefind-sort="title">F1CVTL, F1CVTL2, F2CVTL, F2CVTL2</h1><p class="insn_subtitle" data-pagefind-body="1">8-bit floating-point convert to half-precision (vector)</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">This instruction converts each 8-bit floating-point element from the lower
or upper half of the source vector to half-precision while downscaling the value,
and places the results in the 16-bit elements of the destination vector.
<span class="asm-code">F1CVTL</span> and <span class="asm-code">F2CVTL</span> convert the elements from the lower half
of the source vector while scaling the values by 2<sup>-UInt(FPMR.LSCALE[3:0])</sup>
and 2<sup>-UInt(FPMR.LSCALE2[3:0])</sup>, respectively.
<span class="asm-code">F1CVTL2</span> and <span class="asm-code">F2CVTL2</span> convert the elements from the upper half
of the source vector while scaling the values by 2<sup>-UInt(FPMR.LSCALE[3:0])</sup>
and 2<sup>-UInt(FPMR.LSCALE2[3:0])</sup>, respectively.</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">The 8-bit floating-point encoding format for <span class="asm-code">F1CVTL</span> and <span class="asm-code">F1CVTL2</span>
is selected by FPMR.F8S1. The 8-bit floating-point
encoding format for <span class="asm-code">F2CVTL</span> and <span class="asm-code">F2CVTL2</span> is selected by
FPMR.F8S2.</p>
    
